      "summary": "Evidence summary: 4 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "Player feedback describes combat as fast roguelite dungeon crawling built around improvising with breakable office objects and other situational weapons; the unusual item pool creates variety but the chaotic feel is not equally satisfying to every player.",
