            "feedback-003"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "difficulty",
          "statement": "Difficulty and control feel divide players: some enjoy repeated attempts and the need to learn enemy patterns, while others report that later encounters expose imprecise or overly busy combat, especially because dodging cannot interrupt an attack.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
          "evidence_languages": [
            "russian",
